  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"QPmpr\" id=\"QPmpr\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc48c8791\" id=\"uc48c8791\">1. 元组简介</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ufb532ec5\" id=\"ufb532ec5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d307f45\" id=\"u5d307f45\">Python的元组与列表类似，也是容器的一种,不同之处在于元组的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udef9a738\" id=\"udef9a738\">元素不能修改</span></strong></p><ul list=\"uacc4222e\"><li fid=\"uc0f2e4bc\" data-lake-id=\"u7d14d9a2\" id=\"u7d14d9a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub964cc91\" id=\"ub964cc91\">用于存储 一串 数据，元素之间使用 , 分隔</span></li><li fid=\"uc0f2e4bc\" data-lake-id=\"u4e7d1984\" id=\"u4e7d1984\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue30e5caa\" id=\"ue30e5caa\">元组的索引从 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud95198bd\" id=\"ud95198bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae124c59\" id=\"uae124c59\">0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u112842b0\" id=\"u112842b0\"> 开始</span></li><li fid=\"uc0f2e4bc\" data-lake-id=\"u0ae691ac\" id=\"u0ae691ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3699a03b\" id=\"u3699a03b\">元组的类型：tuple</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"OCcoq\" id=\"OCcoq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u151d2ffb\" id=\"u151d2ffb\">2. 元组的定义</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ue1ed2b2b\" id=\"ue1ed2b2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58641642\" id=\"u58641642\">元组用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u23673acf\" id=\"u23673acf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60256d73\" id=\"u60256d73\">()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2971b4ba\" id=\"u2971b4ba\"> 定义</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22names_tuple%20%3D%20('%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E'%2C'%E5%BC%A0%E6%9B%BC%E7%8E%89'%2C'%E8%83%A1%E6%85%A7%E4%B8%AD')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eyoAw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"udd23853f\" id=\"udd23853f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf22e82c9\" id=\"uf22e82c9\">注意:一个元素的元组定义需要在元素后加上,</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%20%E2%9D%8C%5Cnnames_tuple%20%3D%20('%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E')%5Cn%23%20%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%20%E2%9C%85%5Cnnames_tuple%20%3D%20('%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E'%2C)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IUHOb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"uDFE4\" id=\"uDFE4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub59c0efe\" id=\"ub59c0efe\">3. 元组的特点和作用</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u72318f57\" id=\"u72318f57\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7f34f1fe\" id=\"u7f34f1fe\">元组作为一种高级数据类型，具备如下的特点</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"WYMmq\" id=\"WYMmq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14b03391\" id=\"u14b03391\">自动组包</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ue15c50d7\" id=\"ue15c50d7\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4be4a011\" id=\"u4be4a011\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue893b36c\" id=\"ue893b36c\">t</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubd56002a\" id=\"ubd56002a\">的类型是元组类型,这就是元组的自动组包特征</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22t%20%3D%20'%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E'%2C'%E5%BC%A0%E6%9B%BC%E7%8E%89'%2C'%E7%8E%8B%E7%A5%96%E8%B4%A4'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sLEBQ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"lncBW\" id=\"lncBW\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43a16f28\" id=\"u43a16f28\">自动解包</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%85%83%E7%BB%84%5Cnt%20%3D%20('%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E'%2C'%E5%BC%A0%E6%9B%BC%E7%8E%89'%2C'%E7%8E%8B%E7%A5%96%E8%B4%A4')%5Cn%23%20%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%E8%B5%8B%E5%80%BC%5Cnname1%2Cname2%2Cname3%20%3D%20t%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VlvIU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u4dac5af4\" id=\"u4dac5af4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47e7d843\" id=\"u47e7d843\">元组</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3e0b0237\" id=\"u3e0b0237\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8875ed24\" id=\"u8875ed24\">t</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uef6f104d\" id=\"uef6f104d\">会自动解包分别赋值给</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufd0a4b36\" id=\"ufd0a4b36\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue047d396\" id=\"ue047d396\">name1</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u95ae6e38\" id=\"u95ae6e38\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"u75ba9555\" id=\"u75ba9555\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf8105c0d\" id=\"uf8105c0d\">name2</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u54dd02ac\" id=\"u54dd02ac\">、</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc63c97ff\" id=\"uc63c97ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u738fea42\" id=\"u738fea42\">name3</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6da4ac2f\" id=\"u6da4ac2f\">三个变量</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u036332c2\" id=\"u036332c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb3765f3\" id=\"ubb3765f3\">注意：左边变量的个数一定要和元组的元素个数保持一致</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Vyu7s\" id=\"Vyu7s\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0c6a1437\" id=\"u0c6a1437\">交换数据</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u49195ccf\" id=\"u49195ccf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u777ff1f1\" id=\"u777ff1f1\">交换数据在其它语言中的实现如下:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%20%3D%2010%5Cnb%20%3D%2020%5Cn%23%20%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2a%E5%92%8Cb%5Cntmp%20%3D%20a%5Cna%20%3D%20b%5Cnb%20%3D%20tmp%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K3Mln%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1e7c2964\" id=\"u1e7c2964\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue98c129e\" id=\"ue98c129e\">可以利用元组的组包和解包特点,，速交换两个数据</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a%20%3D%2010%5Cnb%20%3D%2020%5Cn%23%20%E4%BA%A4%E6%8D%A2a%E5%92%8Cb%5Cna%2Cb%20%3D%20b%2Ca%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KRwZj%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u35d13b74\" id=\"u35d13b74\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue00b50b2\" id=\"ue00b50b2\">上述交换，首先右边会进行自动组包，组成新的元组</span><code data-lake-id=\"u3bc6b43f\" id=\"u3bc6b43f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb98631a\" id=\"ucb98631a\">(20,10)</span></code></p><p data-lake-id=\"u29031cd0\" id=\"u29031cd0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub53c5c1d\" id=\"ub53c5c1d\">左边会把元组解包，元素分别赋值给</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf8c78a05\" id=\"uf8c78a05\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72464070\" id=\"u72464070\">a</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u401ceaad\" id=\"u401ceaad\">和</span><code data-lake-id=\"u892256af\" id=\"u892256af\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue0b3009f\" id=\"ue0b3009f\">b</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf1f6092e\" id=\"uf1f6092e\">，最终实现交换的功能</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"hPIin\" id=\"hPIin\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21ff75de\" id=\"u21ff75de\">让列表不可修改</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u875cc5ae\" id=\"u875cc5ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73bf4303\" id=\"u73bf4303\">有时我们传递列表数据给别人使用，希望别人不要修改列表</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u009fc047\" id=\"u009fc047\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c067eb6\" id=\"u7c067eb6\">可以把列表转换成元组，这样就变成了不可变的数据</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22lst%20%3D%20%5B10%2C%2020%2C%2030%5D%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E8%BD%AC%E6%8D%A2%E6%88%90%E5%85%83%E7%BB%84%5Cntp%20%3D%20tuple(lst)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E5%A6%82%E4%B8%8B%E7%B1%BB%E4%BC%BC%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%5Cntp%5B0%5D%20%3D%20111%5Cntp.append(222)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BZcEi%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u5e250241\" id=\"u5e250241\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77a3c414\" id=\"u77a3c414\">如果运行执行会报出如下错误：</span><code data-lake-id=\"uccfb04e7\" id=\"uccfb04e7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u207ebb06\" id=\"u207ebb06\">TypeError: 'tuple' object does not support item assignment</span></code></p>",
